// Title: Remote Utilities Host Service Install
// ID: 85cce894-dd8b-4427-a958-5cc47a4dc9b9
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-31
// Tags: attack.persistence
// Description: Detects Remote Utilities Host service installation on the target system.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where ((winlog.provider_name == "Service Control Manager" and winlog.event_id == 7045) and (((ImagePath like "*_\\rutserv.exe*" and ImagePath like "*_-service*")) or (ServiceName == "Remote Utilities - Host")))
